"Drawing: Disable indicator icons that appear in the top right of a session?\nThis includes the following indicators: maximized pane, broadcast input, coprocess running, alert on next mark, output suppression, zoom, copy mode, and debug logging." = "Drawing: Disable indicator icons that appear in the top right of a session?\nThis includes the following indicators: maximized pane, broadcast input, coprocess running, alert on next mark, output suppression, zoom, copy mode, and debug logging.";
"Drawing: Draw certain Powerline symbols double-width?\nThis matches how most “nerd” fonts render them, but your favorite one might not do this. An example code point that is affected is U+E0B8." = "Drawing: Draw certain Powerline symbols double-width?\nThis matches how most “nerd” fonts render them, but your favorite one might not do this. An example code point that is affected is U+E0B8.";
"Drawing: Draw outline around underline and vertical bar cursors using background color." = "Drawing: Draw outline around underline and vertical bar cursors using background color.";
