"Drawing: Maximum frame rate (FPS) when low power mode is enabled." = "Drawing: Maximum frame rate (FPS) when low power mode is enabled.";
"Drawing: Maximum horizontal distance in cells for smooth cursor slide animation.\nCursor movements larger than this will not animate." = "Drawing: Maximum horizontal distance in cells for smooth cursor slide animation.\nCursor movements larger than this will not animate.";
"Drawing: Metal renderer uses integrated GPU when not connected to power?\nFor this to be effective you must disable “Disable Metal renderer when not connected to power”." = "Drawing: Metal renderer uses integrated GPU when not connected to power?\nFor this to be effective you must disable “Disable Metal renderer when not connected to power”.";
"Drawing: Minimum weight difference between regular and bold font.\nThis affects selection of the bold version of a font. Font weights go from 0 to 9. If no font can be found that has a high enough weight then the regular font will be double-struck with a small offset." = "Drawing: Minimum weight difference between regular and bold font.\nThis affects selection of the bold version of a font. Font weights go from 0 to 9. If no font can be found that has a high enough weight then the regular font will be double-struck with a small offset.";
