"Scripting: Use uv to provision the Python runtime for API scripts?\nWhen enabled, iTerm2 uses uv to download Python and build per-script environments instead of the bundled Python runtime. Scripts already provisioned continue to run regardless of this setting; it only affects creating, importing, and migrating scripts." = "Scripting: Use uv to provision the Python runtime for API scripts?\nWhen enabled, iTerm2 uses uv to download Python and build per-script environments instead of the bundled Python runtime. Scripts already provisioned continue to run regardless of this setting; it only affects creating, importing, and migrating scripts.";
