"Semantic History: Characters never considered part of a URL.\nThe characters in this string may never occur in a URL; when one is seen that delineates the beginning or end of a URL." = "Semantic History: Characters never considered part of a URL.\nThe characters in this string may never occur in a URL; when one is seen that delineates the beginning or end of a URL.";
