"Windows: Dark themes give terminal windows black title bars by default." = "Windows: Dark themes give terminal windows black title bars by default.";
"Windows: Disable documented edited indicator (black dot in close button)" = "Windows: Disable documented edited indicator (black dot in close button)";
"Windows: Disable the window shadow on High Sierra and earlier when the window has a transparent session to prevent text shadows." = "Windows: Disable the window shadow on High Sierra and earlier when the window has a transparent session to prevent text shadows.";
